msgid "A measured 404. The author is told the address and that the first build has not landed there yet."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:176
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A PERSON'S STEP: the scan's `markers` that are not yet declared are offered as selectable options — one per marker, each with its paths and what declaring it means, plus \"none of these\" — and the person picks which parts of the repository to load into the KG. A tap card where the host has one; otherwise a numbered pick-list with a stated default. Never a typed reply. The default declares NOTHING. Only the picks reach Task_Scaffold, which declares exactly those in index.config.json. With no undeclared marker found, nothing is asked. The same question is put after setup by running the scan with `--markers` (repo-conversion §2a)."
msgstr ""

