#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Answers the one question Gateway_Intent cannot compute for itself — \"ask\" is one of five outcomes decisions/folio-intent.dmn can return — and, only on the overlay path, the questions a repo scan cannot answer on its own: which of the content markers it found the harness should declare (Task_ChooseHarnessed), then what to import, where it goes, and who does the importing."
msgstr ""

