msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:139
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Computed, not chosen. decisions/folio-intent.dmn returns one of five branches from statedIntent, isFolio and repoHasContent. Non-relaxable."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:274
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Confirmed live. The link is given as a link, and the author is told what is on it."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:216
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "content/, uploads/, library/, the first manifests, <slug>.json and index.config.json (the layer's config inline in its entry; no <slug>.config.json), the builder shim, AGENTS.md with its stubs, .mcp.json, the session-start hook and the beans store. On the overlay path it declares in index.config.json exactly the markers picked at Task_ChooseHarnessed, and none it was not given. Refuses rather than overwrites when a folio is already present."
msgstr ""

